@dvp_majority
title: <span style="color: var(--dvp-color);">**[+ dvp_name +]**</span> majority alone
view-if: dvp_r >= 50
subtitle: <span style="color: var(--dvp-color);">**[+ dvp_name +]**</span>: [+ dvp_r +]%
on-arrival: dvp_in_government = 1; in_dvp_majority = 1; chancellor = "Empty"; chancellor_party = dvp_name; foreign_minister_party = dvp_name; foreign_minister = "Stresemann" if no_stresemann == 0; foreign_minister = "Curtius" if no_stresemann; interior_minister_party = dvp_name; interior_minister = "Jarres"; justice_minister_party = dvp_name; justice_minister = "Heinze" if ddp_exist; justice_minister = "Schiffer" if ddp_exist == 0; labor_minister_party = dvp_name; labor_minister = "Thiel"; reichswehr_minister_party = dvp_name; reichswehr_minister = "Seeckt"; economic_minister_party = dvp_name; economic_minister = "Krohne" if ddp_exist; economic_minister = "Hamm" if ddp_exist == 0; finance_minister_party = dvp_name; finance_minister = "Moldenhauer"; agriculture_minister_party = dvp_name; agriculture_minister = "Kanitz"; reichswehr_loyalty -= 0.05; 
achievement: majority_party

Finally, the <span style="color: var(--dvp-color);">**[+ dvp_name +]**</span> can govern alone! Our long campaign of electioneering has paid off. We do not need to worry about coalition government; anything is possible. 

Who should be chancellor?

- @scholz_majority_chancellor: Ernst Scholz for Chancellor.
- @dietrich_majority_chancellor: Hermann Dietrich for Chancellor.
- @stresemann_majority_chancellor: Gustav Stresemann for Chancellor.
- @curtius_majority_chancellor: Julius Curtius for Chancellor.

@scholz_majority_chancellor
on-arrival: chancellor = "Scholz"
face-image: img/portraits/ScholzErnst.jpg

Ernst Scholz has become chancellor of the <span style="color: var(--dvp-color);">**[+ dvp_name +]**</span> majority.

@dietrich_majority_chancellor
view-if: ddp_exist == 0
on-arrival: chancellor = "Dietrich"
face-image: img/portraits/DietrichHermann.jpg

Hermann Dietrich has become chancellor of the <span style="color: var(--dvp-color);">**[+ dvp_name +]**</span> majority.

@stresemann_majority_chancellor
view-if: no_stresemann = 0
on-arrival: chancellor = "Stresemann"
face-image: img/portraits/StresemannGustav.jpg

Gustav Stresemann has become chancellor of the <span style="color: var(--dvp-color);">**[+ dvp_name +]**</span> majority.

@curtius_majority_chancellor
view-if: no_stresemann = 1
on-arrival: chancellor = "Curtius"
face-image: img/portraits/CurtiusJulius.jpg

Julius Curtius has become chancellor of the <span style="color: var(--dvp-color);">**[+ dvp_name +]**</span> majority.


@liberal_coalition
title: We can form a Liberal Coalition.
subtitle: <span style="color: var(--dvp-color);">**[+ dvp_name +]**</span> + <span style="color: #DCCA4A;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span> ([+ liberal_coalition +]%)
view-if: liberal_coalition >= 50 and ddp_exist
on-arrival: leverage += 5; ddp_in_government = 1; dvp_in_government = 1; in_liberal_coalition = 1; chancellor = "Dietrich"; chancellor_party = ddp_name; foreign_minister_party = ddp_name; foreign_minister = "Solf"; interior_minister_party = ddp_name; interior_minister = "Koch-Weser"; justice_minister_party = ddp_name; justice_minister = "Koch-Weser"; labor_minister_party = ddp_name; labor_minister = "Erkelenz"; reichswehr_minister_party = ddp_name; reichswehr_minister = "Gessler"; economic_minister_party = ddp_name; economic_minister = "Dietrich"; finance_minister_party = ddp_name; finance_minister = "Dietrich"; agriculture_minister_party = ddp_name; agriculture_minister = "Dietrich";

We have enough votes to form a "Liberal Coalition" government consisting of the <span style="color: var(--dvp-color);">**[+ dvp_name +]**</span> and <span style="color: #DCCA4A;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>!

Who should be the chancellor?

- @curtius_coalition_chancellor
- @dietrich_coalition_chancellor

@curtius_coalition_chancellor
title: Julius Curtius for Chancellor
subtitle: Curtius is a member of our Stresemannite wing.
on-arrival: chancellor = "Curtius"; chancellor_party = dvp_name; leverage -= 5
face-image: img/portraits/CurtiusJulius.jpg
go-to: ministries

Julius Curtius has been appointed chancellor.

@dietrich_coalition_chancellor
