subtitle: Dietrich is a member of [+ ddp_name +] Business wing.
on-arrival: chancellor = "Dietrich"; chancellor_party = ddp_name;
face-image: img/portraits/DietrichHermann.jpg
go-to: ministries

Hermann Dietrich has been appointed chancellor.


@spd_majority
title: The <span style="color: #E3000F;">**SPD**</span> secures a majority
view-if: spd_r >= 50
subtitle: <span style="color: #E3000F;">**SPD**</span>: [+ spd_r +]%
on-arrival: spd_in_government = 1; in_spd_majority = 1; chancellor = "Müller" if muller_dead == 0; chancellor = "Wels" if muller_dead == 1; chancellor_party = "SPD"; foreign_minister_party = "SPD"; foreign_minister = "Breitscheid"; interior_minister_party = "SPD"; interior_minister = "Severing"; justice_minister_party = "SPD"; justice_minister = "Radbruch"; labor_minister_party = "SPD"; labor_minister = "Wissell"; reichswehr_minister_party = "SPD"; reichswehr_minister = "Leber"; economic_minister_party = "SPD"; economic_minister = "Schmidt"; finance_minister_party = "SPD"; finance_minister = "Hilferding"; agriculture_minister_party = "SPD"; agriculture_minister = "Baade"; pro_republic += 5;

Somehow, the <span style="color: #E3000F;">**SPD**</span> has won a majority. They now have limitless power to change Germany in their image. [? if muller_dead == 0: Hermann Müller ?][? if muller_dead == 1: Otto Wels ?] has become chancellor.


@social_liberal_coalition
title: Let us try a Social-Liberal coalition
view-if: social_liberal_coalition >= 50
subtitle: <span style="color: #E3000F;">**SPD**</span> + [? if ddp_exist: <span style="color: #DCCA4A;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span> + ?] <span style="color: var(--dvp-color);">**[+ dvp_name +]**</span> ([+ social_liberal_coalition +]%)
on-arrival: leverage += 5; spd_in_government = 1; ddp_in_government = 1 if ddp_exist; dvp_in_government = 1; in_social_liberal_coalition = 1; chancellor = "Müller" if muller_dead == 0; chancellor = "Wels" if muller_dead == 1; chancellor_party = "SPD"; foreign_minister_party = "SPD"; foreign_minister = "Breitscheid"; interior_minister_party = "SPD"; interior_minister = "Severing"; justice_minister_party = "SPD"; justice_minister = "Radbruch"; labor_minister_party = "SPD"; labor_minister = "Wissell"; reichswehr_minister_party = "SPD"; reichswehr_minister = "Leber"; economic_minister_party = "SPD"; economic_minister = "Schmidt"; finance_minister_party = "SPD"; finance_minister = "Hilferding"; agriculture_minister_party = "SPD"; agriculture_minister = "Baade";

We have decided to form a Social-Liberal coalition with the <span style="color: #E3000F;">**SPD**</span>. A coalition like this has never been tried before, we have increased leverage when picking our ministries, and the <span style="color: #000000;">**Center**</span> can't bring down the cabinet if we secularize education. Now we must choose who will be chancellor.

- @curtius_social_liberal_coalition
- @SPD_social_liberal_coalition_1
- @SPD_social_liberal_coalition_2

