@grand_coalition
title: We can form a Grand Coalition.
view-if: grand_coalition >= 50 and weimar_coalition < 50 and grand_coalition_failed == 0
subtitle: <span style="color: #E3000F;">**SPD**</span> + <span style="color: #000000;">**Z**</span> + <span style="color: #69A2BE;">**BVP**</span> + [? if ddp_exist: <span style="color: #DCCA4A;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span> + ?] <span style="color: var(--dvp-color);">**[+ dvp_name +]**</span> [? if aspd_exist and aspd_ideology = "Moderate": + <span style="color: #FE9E00;">**ASPD**</span> ?][? if csrp_exist:  + <span style="color: #FF6B21;">**CSRP**</span>?] ([+ grand_coalition +]%)
go-to: grand_coalition_success if spd_relation >= 50 or no_stresemann == 0; grand_coalition_stall if spd_relation < 50 and no_stresemann

As expected, the <span style="color: #E3000F;">**SPD**</span> is the largest party, and this time, they are expected to take the lead role in the formation of the next government, including selecting the chancellor. President [+ president +] has asked the <span style="color: #E3000F;">**SPD**</span> to form a majority coalition with the <span style="color: #000000;">**Center Party**</span>, <span style="color: #69A2BE;">**BVP**</span>[? if ddp_exist: , <span style="color: #DCCA4A;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span> ?], and <span style="color: var(--dvp-color);">**[+ dvp_name +]**</span>.

[? if spd_relation < 20 : As our relation with the <span style="color: #E3000F;">**SPD**</span> is poor, they are demanding more minister posts in order to remain part of the coalition. ?]

